@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Process Sale"

[*] --> WaitingForNewSale

state "Waiting for new sale" as WaitingForNewSale
state "Recording items" as RecordingItems
state "Waiting for payment" as WaitingForPayment

WaitingForNewSale --> RecordingItems : enter item
RecordingItems --> RecordingItems : enter item
RecordingItems --> WaitingForPayment : all items added
WaitingForPayment --> WaitingForNewSale : complete sale with cash
WaitingForPayment --> VerifyPayment : verify payment (card or check)
VerifyPayment --> WaitingForNewSale : payment approved

@enduml
